---
const questions = [
  {
    question: "Which lab should I choose?",
    answer:
      "Start with your workload and budget. Virtual Labs uses slower nested virtualization; VDL and ElasticLabs VMs run directly on a bare-metal hypervisor. Compare resources and networking in each plan.",
    href: "/pricing/",
    label: "Compare product families",
  },
  {
    question: "Do I need IPv4, IPv6, or NAT?",
    answer:
      "Choose public IPv4 for direct IPv4 access, or IPv6 if your connections support it. NAT uses private IPv4 behind a shared endpoint; available inbound access depends on the plan.",
    href: "/docs/servers/network/",
    label: "Read the networking guide",
  },
  {
    question: "Which locations and operating systems are available?",
    answer:
      "Client Panel shows current locations, stock, and images. Operating system choices, including Windows support, depend on the service.",
    href: "https://my.8labs.id",
    label: "Check the current catalog",
  },
  {
    question: "What will I pay, and when does billing stop?",
    answer:
      "Checkout shows the amount, currency or LAB Coin unit, tax, billing period, and renewal terms. Stopping or deleting a VM may not stop charges: use Client Panel’s cancellation process.",
    href: "/docs/billing-plans/overview/",
    label: "Understand billing and cancellation",
  },
  {
    question: "How long until I can use my server?",
    answer:
      "Timing varies by service and installation. Follow the order and installation status, not just payment or a Running label. If setup fails, contact support before reordering.",
    href: "/docs/getting-started/intro/#wait-for-provisioning",
    label: "Follow the first-access guide",
  },
  {
    question: "Are backups included?",
    answer:
      "Backup and retention options vary by plan. A snapshot can share your server’s failure boundary; keep an independent copy of important data and test restores.",
    href: "/docs/servers/backups/",
    label: "Review recovery options",
  },
  {
    question: "Where do I order, manage my server, or get help?",
    answer:
      "Order, manage billing, and get private support in Client Panel. Use your service’s management link for Cloud Panel server controls. Keep secrets and service details out of public chat.",
    href: "/docs/help/contact/",
    label: "Find the right support path",
  },
];
---

<section
  class="border-t border-grid py-12 md:py-16"
  aria-labelledby="purchase-questions-heading">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <div>
      <h2
        id="purchase-questions-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-line md:text-4xl">
        Questions before you start
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cool">
        Choose with confidence. Your plan and checkout hold the service details.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 min-w-0 border-t border-grid">
      {
        questions.map((item) => (
          <details class="border-b border-grid">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer py-5 pr-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-line hover:text-red-ink">
              {item.question}
            </summary>
            <div class="max-w-prose pb-6 pr-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cool">
              <p>{item.answer}</p>
              <a
                href={item.href}
                class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-[2.75rem] items-center font-medium text-red-ink underline underline-offset-4">
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
